Hand 1
http://tinyurl.com/23bme2vt
qx|A1|st||rh||ah|Board 1 IMPs   -    February 28, 2024|pn|hondo717,danpsych,IraCT,adriennek|
md|3SKT5H984DA74CJ652,SA32HJ3DK96CAKQ73,SQJ9764HKQ52D8C94,S8HAT76DQJT532CT8|sv|0|
mb|2S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Many play that they won't open a weak 2 with an outside 4-card major. But Marty Bergen thinks that is a very silly rule and I 100% agree. Preempts are wonderful bids and you should strain to make them, not look for excuses not to preempt.|
PG| ***** 1 ***** |


mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|3S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|And when partner opens a preempt, |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=lott,Law of Total Tricks^*N|CP||FP||at| applies which is why I bid 3@S.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 2 ***** |


mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West pass was reasonable, but 3NT is possible although very risky.|
PG| ***** 3 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BA Kib: ^*NCould West maybe double?|
PG| ***** 4 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Definitely not with only 2 hearts. The choices are pass, best one, 3N, very risky, or 4@C, acceptable.|
PG| ***** 5 ***** |


