qx|A2|st||rh||ah|Board 2 IMPs   -    February 28, 2024|pn|hondo717,danpsych,IraCT,adriennek|
md|4SJ987HQ742D852CA5,SQ62HT95DKJTCJ982,SAKT43HK63DA964CT,S5HAJ8DQ73CKQ7643|sv|n|
mb|1C|mb|P|mb|1N|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|1NT is reasonable unless you play that 1N shows 8-10 over 1@C, which some play. In that case, West has to bid 1@D which (as on this hand) must be done with a 3-card suit when 1N is 8-10.|
PG| ***** 25 ***** |


mb|2S|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I would like to make the LOTT bid of 3@S but it is unclear in this auction that 3@S is just competing so I opted to pass.|
PG| ***** 26 ***** |


mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I will discuss the two passes by West and East after the play.|
