mb|1H|mb|2C2H|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@H is not correct. It shows exactly 3 hearts. With 4 hearts, North should either bid 3H with less than a limit raise or 3@C. I also happen to play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenraises,Bergen Raises^*N|CP||FP||at| are still on after a 2@C overcall but that is not standard.|
PG| ***** 47 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North hand has 9 HCP and 1 point for the doubleton for 10 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dummypoints,Dummy Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. So regardless of whether or not you play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenraises,Bergen Raises^*N|CP||FP||at|, North has a 3@C bid for sure. Let me give North an undo.|
PG| ***** 48 ***** |


