UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Unfortunately 2@C did not work out well despite the 3-3 break, though partner could have had a better hand. 2@C particularly given the auction where North will often have 4 clubs, and being vulnerable, is somewhat more risky than if not vulnerable.|
PG| ***** 85 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|On the other hand, I am pretty sure we would make 1N. And if we make 2N or even 3N, -200 vs say -120, although not great, is not awful. Not vulnerable, -100 would be fine.|
PG| ***** 86 ***** |


