UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I agree with the 2@S balancing bid particularly given EW is not vulnerable. It was a reasonable bid. West has pretty nice spades and nice 5-4-2-2 distribution.|
