nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|On the other hand, admittedly passing 2@D did not rate to be a particularly good board. In 3@D, we take 6 diamonds, 3 hearts, 1 club, and 1 spade. So -150 was a push--a tie.|
